# Prepared JSON transport rebuilt from checked-in object preparation output.
# Nothing under prepared/ is tracked. Baked files move to R2 through each object's inventory.json
# (packages/bake/src/delivery/runtime-assets.ts, packages/bake/src/asset-publication/setup-assets.ts); object.json and page.json
# are regenerated by predev. A file cited as evidence lives in evidence/, not here.
/src/objects/*/prepared/

